  "notes": "{支出|ししゅつ} refers to expenditure or expenses, often used in formal or financial contexts.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {支出|ししゅつ}を{抑|おさ}える (to reduce expenses)\n- {支出|ししゅつ}を{削減|さくげん}する (to cut expenses)\n- {支出|ししゅつ}が{増|ふ}える (expenses increase)\n\nANTONYM:\n- {収入|しゅうにゅう} (income) ↔ {支出|ししゅつ} (expenditure)\n\nRELATED TERMS:\n- {出費|しゅっぴ} (expense, spending - slightly more casual)\n- {経費|けいひ} (operating expenses, costs)",
